{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firewheels Shop Simulator</strong> lets you manage a diecast model store. Organize shelves, assist customers, and expand your shop in a detailed, realistic world. Join our Discord to connect with other players and share your diecast shop experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.poster.avif?t=1756584532\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.webm?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.mp4?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Diecast Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the ultimate diecast empire from the ground up. Design, manage, and grow your dream diecast shop in a bustling city where your creativity and strategy will lead to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange diecast models on shelves, optimize store layout for aesthetics and efficiency, and create an inviting shopping experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.poster.avif?t=1756584532\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.webm?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.mp4?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and decorate every corner of your store to create a charming and personalized shopping environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Licenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy licenses from top brands to stock a wide range of diecast models. Add variety to your shop and attract more customers with every new brand you bring in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.poster.avif?t=1756584532\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.webm?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.mp4?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Rare Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for rare and chase cars to add to your collection. Attract diecast enthusiasts and collectors by offering exclusive items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade with Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with customers to trade diecast models. Build relationships and create a loyal customer base through fair and exciting trades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store\u2019s physical space, upgrade interiors, and continually adapt to meet customer demands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process and deliver online orders with a scooter, ensuring timely and accurate delivery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diecast Trading System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advertisement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banking &amp; Credit Systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security Cameras &amp; Shoplifters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warehouse &amp; Inventory Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant &amp; Interactive City</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Diecast Shop Simulator and build your dream diecast store from the ground up!<br><br><strong>DEMO</strong><br>This demo version of <i>Firewheels Shop Simulator</i> allows players to experience the core gameplay mechanics. Included in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f 30 different diecast car models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Shelf placement system to organize your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Customer interactions and sales system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Store customization and decoration features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can test these features to get a feel for the gameplay and see what awaits in the full version.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526130?t=1756584532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/3b8698d748fd1e2e78a2d2a5eff7f6ced2cf27b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756584532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/88e2de6ad4317282d20c0fd04fd43b5d5ec585da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756584532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/88e2de6ad4317282d20c0fd04fd43b5d5ec585da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756584532","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firewheels Shop Simulator</strong> lets you manage a diecast model store. Organize shelves, assist customers, and expand your shop in a detailed, realistic world. Join our Discord to connect with other players and share your diecast shop experiences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.poster.avif?t=1756584532\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.webm?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/122553298ef673ce2961543e04763e43.mp4?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Diecast Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the ultimate diecast empire from the ground up. Design, manage, and grow your dream diecast shop in a bustling city where your creativity and strategy will lead to success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manager</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange diecast models on shelves, optimize store layout for aesthetics and efficiency, and create an inviting shopping experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.poster.avif?t=1756584532\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.webm?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/4c88f4c842c6fbaf71e06e153557a0c3.mp4?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and decorate every corner of your store to create a charming and personalized shopping environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Licenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy licenses from top brands to stock a wide range of diecast models. Add variety to your shop and attract more customers with every new brand you bring in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.poster.avif?t=1756584532\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.webm?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526130/extras/8413e13241be97b501ea41e323161dd3.mp4?t=1756584532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Rare Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for rare and chase cars to add to your collection. Attract diecast enthusiasts and collectors by offering exclusive items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade with Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with customers to trade diecast models. Build relationships and create a loyal customer base through fair and exciting trades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store\u2019s physical space, upgrade interiors, and continually adapt to meet customer demands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process and deliver online orders with a scooter, ensuring timely and accurate delivery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diecast Trading System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning Mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advertisement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banking &amp; Credit Systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Security Cameras &amp; Shoplifters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warehouse &amp; Inventory Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant &amp; Interactive City</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Diecast Shop Simulator and build your dream diecast store from the ground up!<br><br><strong>DEMO</strong><br>This demo version of <i>Firewheels Shop Simulator</i> allows players to experience the core gameplay mechanics. Included in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f 30 different diecast car models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Shelf placement system to organize your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Customer interactions and sales system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Store customization and decoration features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can test these features to get a feel for the gameplay and see what awaits in the full version.</p>","developers":["AlkameGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3481370","name":"Firewheels Shop Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_